{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_4_objects_and_classes_05_the_prototype_chain_03_writing_and_mutation_write_creates_own_property", "label": "A write creates an own property", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-4-objects-and-classes/05-the-prototype-chain/03-writing-and-mutation.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Reads walk the chain; writes do not. Assignment shadows a prototype data property. The prototype and other inheritors are untouched."}, {"id": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_4_objects_and_classes_05_the_prototype_chain_03_writing_and_mutation_shared_mutable_prototype_state", "label": "Shared mutable prototype state", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-4-objects-and-classes/05-the-prototype-chain/03-writing-and-mutation.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Fn.prototype.items = [] is one array shared by every instance. push is a read then a mutation, so no shadowing own property is created. Create per-instance fields instead."}, {"id": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_4_objects_and_classes_05_the_prototype_chain_03_writing_and_mutation_inherited_setter_intercept", "label": "Inherited setters intercept writes", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-4-objects-and-classes/05-the-prototype-chain/03-writing-and-mutation.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "If the chain has a setter for that key, the setter runs and no own property is created. A read-only inherited property throws TypeError in strict mode instead of shadowing."}, {"id": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_4_objects_and_classes_05_the_prototype_chain_03_writing_and_mutation_setprototypeof_deopt", "label": "Object.setPrototypeOf deoptimization", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-4-objects-and-classes/05-the-prototype-chain/03-writing-and-mutation.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Engines optimise the chain at creation time. Changing it causes recompile for de-optimization. Set the chain at creation with { __proto__: proto } or Object.create."}, {"id": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_4_objects_and_classes_05_the_prototype_chain_03_writing_and_mutation_keep_chain_short", "label": "Keep the prototype chain short", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-4-objects-and-classes/05-the-prototype-chain/03-writing-and-mutation.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A miss visits every level. Two or three levels is normal; ten is a smell. Extending built-in prototypes lengthens the chain for every object of that type."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_4_objects_and_classes_05_the_prototype_chain_03_writing_and_mutation_write_creates_own_property", "target": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_4_objects_and_classes_05_the_prototype_chain_01_how_lookup_walks_property_shadowing", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-4-objects-and-classes/05-the-prototype-chain/03-writing-and-mutation.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_4_objects_and_classes_05_the_prototype_chain_03_writing_and_mutation_shared_mutable_prototype_state", "target": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_4_objects_and_classes_05_the_prototype_chain_03_writing_and_mutation_write_creates_own_property", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-4-objects-and-classes/05-the-prototype-chain/03-writing-a